      "│                                            │    - Desktop shortcut                                      │",
      "│  ✗ GuildShopSync using old Scheduled Task  │    - Start Menu entry                                     │",
      "│                                            │                                                            │",
      "│  ✗ GBankExport using PowerShell + VBS      │  ✓ Settings GUI to select:                                │",
      "│                                            │    - Which accounts to sync                                │",
      "│  ✗ No bank alt inventory scanning          │    - Which characters per account                         │",
      "│                                            │    - Enable/disable individual syncs                       │",
      "│  ✗ No way to select accounts/characters    │                                                            │",
      "│                                            │  ✓ Single unified tray app handles:                       │",
      "│  ✗ Guild bank data local only              │    - AH price sync                                        │",
      "│    (not uploading to website)              │    - Guild vault sync                                     │",
      "│                                            │    - Bank alt inventory sync (selected only)              │",
      "│  ✗ No combined storage view                │                                                            │",
      "│                                            │  ✓ Website shows combined Guild Storage view              │",
      "│                                            │    with 3 tabs: Vault, Bank Alts, Combined                │",
      "│                                            │                                                            │",
